		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Stinking, putrid mass of flesh that was once a cultist of Yog-Sothoth. Considered a divine blessing by the cult.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 tentacle +5 (1d6 + bleed), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Blur</strong>. Hazy, flickers and fades, hard to perceive unless insane. Attacks against spawn have DISADV.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
